# Research record artifact handling — see docs/research/AGENT_INSTRUCTIONS.md §7.6.
#
# SVG is the authoring format for every figure and diagram: text, diffable, and
# reviewable in a PR. PDF is the LaTeX-facing export of the same figure and is
# binary — never the source of truth, and never the only copy.

*.svg   text eol=lf diff
*.pdf   binary
*.png   binary

# Small machine-readable results stay in git and must diff cleanly.
docs/research/**/*.json  text eol=lf diff
docs/research/**/*.csv   text eol=lf diff
docs/research/**/*.yaml  text eol=lf diff
